* Prototype OTA bias fanout referenced to an external 2.5 V master.
* An existing clean reference is exposed as a pin rather than generated here.
.subckt bias_amp08 ref sense out vdd vss nb
MT tail nb vss vss N W=7.5u L=2.4u
M1 left sense tail vss N W=15u L=2.4u
M2 gain ref tail vss N W=15u L=2.4u
MP1 left left vdd vdd P W=7.5u L=2.4u
MP2 gain left vdd vdd P W=7.5u L=2.4u
MP3 out gain vdd vdd P W=10u L=2.4u
MN3 out nb vss vss N W=15u L=2.4u
MCOMP out gain out out P W=25u L=20u
.ends bias_amp08

.subckt ota_bias08 ref vdd vss vbn vbp iref
XRBIAS vdd nb RPP W=2.4u L=50000u
MB nb nb vss vss N W=20u L=2.4u
XBN ref bn_fb vbn vdd vss nb bias_amp08
XRT vbn bn_fb RPP W=2.4u L=10000u
XRB bn_fb vss RPP W=2.4u L=50000u

* Regulate the voltage across RSET, then mirror the resulting current.
XSET ref sense gate vdd vss nb bias_amp08
MSET pr gate sense vss N W=24u L=4u
XRSET sense vss RPP W=2.4u L=50000u
MPD pr pr vdd vdd P W=18u L=12u
MPI iref pr vdd vdd P W=14u L=12u
MPN nbp pr vdd vdd P W=18u L=12u
MND nbp nbp vss vss N W=15u L=14u
MNO vbp nbp vss vss N W=15u L=14u
XRP vdd vbp RPP W=2.4u L=42500u
.ends ota_bias08
